# Store every text file as LF in the repo regardless of the checkout OS or
# anyone's core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a clone on another machine or in
# CI can rewrite line endings and turn a one-line change into a whole-file diff.
* text=auto

# The rendered icons. `text=auto` guesses, and a guess of "text" on a PNG or an
# ICO rewrites line endings inside the image and corrupts it. Rendered by the
# ignored `render_the_icon` test in src/orb.rs.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.icns binary
